  "metadata": {
    "title": "Flow cytometry FCS files: Cell surface VVL staining of MFSD5, SLC30A8 and SLC30A8-D110N-D224N OE cells",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14720967",
    "publication_date": "2025-01-22",
    "description": "<p>To compare VVL staining intensity distributions in cell populations of MFSD5 vs SLC30A8 WT-OE cell lines, and evaluate effect of transport-deficient mutations D110N &amp; D224N on SLC30A8-mediated VVL staining. As described in manuscript \"Metabolic mapping of the human solute carrier superfamily\" by Wiedmer &amp; Teoh et al.</p>",
